{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:1eb7024ad0dea9cb","name":"5th-Degree Droid Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-1eb7024ad0dea9cb","title":"5th-Degree Droid Talent Tree","revision":25025,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T20:32:23Z","sha256":"2d280d51d7b4f88ec8bc370aae3a6bce5c113bad0fec1041873718a4850d5689","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=25025","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=5th-Degree%20Droid%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-1eb7024ad0dea9cb","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["5th-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/5th-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:d4243a54b2193101"}," are typically Utility Droids with low-level functions. Only they can select Talents from this Droid Talent Tree.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Cargo Hauler"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +5 bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"},"-based ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"},". Additionally, you double your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Carrying Capacity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Carrying_Capacity"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Environmentally Shielded"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," against environmental ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hazards"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hazards"},", including ",{"tag"