d would become ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disabled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disabled"},". The first time during an encounter that you would be moved to the bottom of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by any effect, you instead stop at the -4 step (move at half ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},"; -10 penalty to all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defenses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defenses","referenceId":"reference:0d85b79fde210d9c"},"; -10 penalty on attack rolls, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Checks"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"},"). Additionally, if a single attack causes you to move multiple steps down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to only move -1 step down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Heavy-Duty Actuators"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," Medium or larger size\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your ",{"tag":"b","children":["Heavy-Duty Actuators"]}," allow you to release your power and speed in a quick burst. You can double your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus to your melee and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," damage rolls.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Load Launcher"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are considered proficient with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improvised Thrown Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improvised_Thrown_Weapons"}," when making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," by throwing an object. Objects up to one size category larger than you can be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Thrown"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Thrown"}," up to a number of squares equal to 2 x your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus (minimum 1 square). Additionally, you add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus to any damage dealt.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Task Optimization"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Select a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in. Once per encounter, you can perform any application of that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," as one Action type quicker than normal, but as at least a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," (for example, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wik